      <div class="how-section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">04 / Evaluation</p>
        <h2>A fluent sentence compiles into a small evaluation plan.</h2>
        <p>
          Builders record intent. The terminal check obtains the project graph, selects subjects,
          projects the relevant relationships or metrics, evaluates the condition, and returns
          structured findings. The assertion adapter is deliberately last.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-evaluation-grid">
